WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.200
Gije of the Buff Clan managed to steal the Ideon.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:32.990
However, under the pressure of Cosmo's
 counterattack, he had to part with it again.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.420
Daram and Gije's Heavy Mobile
Mecha fled from the battle.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:57.000
Afterwards, the Solo Ship crew started planning
 an attack against Daram's main forces.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:04.260
<b>Ideon's Counterattack</b>

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:20.610
There's such a big forest left! You can still live here!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.300
Why'd you come all the way here, Cosmo?

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.790
You told me you wanted to stay here on Caral.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.040
I'm a bit worried, so I wanted to survey the area.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:31.830
It's our planet after all! Of course I'll live here!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.960
Hey, if our next attack goes as planned,
why not come with us on the Solo Ship?

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:37.430
Why?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.470
Why, you ask...

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.370
Caral is a nice planet and everything, but...

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.350
I'll protect it!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.640
I'll protect this planet with all my might!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:50.100
Yeah.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.160
Cosmo!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.100
See you later!

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:04.880
Take care.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:05.830
I'll be alright!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.150
Where'd you go at an important time like this?

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.670
Hmph! What's with that Kitten girl?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.330
Huh? Are you jealous?

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.880
Give me a break!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.340
What is it?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.760
Take a look.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.600
This is a map of the known universe,
 presented in a manner that's easy to understand.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.100
I want to know where the Buff Clan homeworld is.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:41.380
It's not like we're going to
 attack them right away, Karala.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.680
I understand your pain, Karala.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:51.000
If our situations were reversed,
I would be distressed as well.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.720
Bes...

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:53.920
Give it some thought.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.880
We'll ask you again once
 this mission is over, Karala.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.770
Hey, Tom! What are you doing?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.510
See! Now they found us!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.760
Tom, Chie! Found you!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.640
The Solo Ship is launching.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.770
Calling all hands! Calling all hands!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.170
The Solo Ship is prepared to launch!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.910
Cooperating with Caral's remaining military forces,

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.800
we are going to strike the Buff Clan fleet.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.610
Our goal in this mission is to eliminate
 the enemy down to the last man.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.530
We can't afford to let a single unit
 survive, as they pose a threat to all humanity!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.110
Best of luck to you all!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.510
If it's a decisive battle, they
should have brought me along!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:52.140
Tom, there are still children hiding in the ruins, right?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.310
Yeah.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.390
Let's go look for them.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.680
So, Harulu sent us two Zigg Mack units?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.570
Yes, sir.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.470
Hmm, a message from her?

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.310
She gave us the Zigg Macks as a reward
 for letting her borrow the Dero Zan.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:40.860
However, taking them in
 might slightly delay our sortie...

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.360
It's fine, we have more battle strength now.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.150
Yes...

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:49.030
What's more, she's going to send a Heavy
 Mobile Mecha built to counter the Giant.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:51.200
A Heavy Mobile Mecha to counter the Giant?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.570
Even Harulu can be amiable sometimes...

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.250
That's not it...

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.460
Something must have happened between
 the military and the Orme Foundation.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:03.130
Do you mean that they've joined forces?

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.500
Something like that.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.090
Enemy ships located!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:07.610
What'd you say?!

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.500
There's a fair number of them!
They have a warship too!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.970
I've been too naive!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.510
Huh?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:18.600
All this time, I've envisioned our next battle
 only from the attacker's perspective!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.690
I forgot the enemy could attack too!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.780
Two battleships! I don't know what the
 rest are, but there's a number of them!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:35.600
Okay.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.160
All Ideon units!

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:37.960
Take off!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.680
Dock immediately and prepare for battle!

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.460
Roger! Ideo-Delta, launching!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.090
Roger!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.360
All units, stop the resupplying.
Take battle preparations!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.700
Warships will come into range
of our missiles in 5 minutes.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:19.910
Listen! The Ganga Lubu, Zigg Mack,
 and Gadal Rou will attack all at once!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:20.570
Yes sir!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.210
They'll be inside missile firing
 range in 60 seconds! You hear me?

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.870
They're at firing range! Clear the way for Ideon!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.930
All ships, open the anti-air cannons!

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.230
Main cannon, fire!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.230
Shoot missiles straight forward!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.460
This is the end! You're finished!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:17.440
The Carioca is too far ahead! Cover it!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.150
The Carioca's been sunk? Damn the Buff Clan!

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:42.750
They're desperate! I never expected those
 Logo Dau aliens to attack at this scale!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:49.620
With this battle, they must have cut off
 negotiations with us Buff Clan for good...

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.010
Not bad!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.160
Bes! We're getting too close to them!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.820
I don't care! Go!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:26.710
What?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.590
That was a suicide attack!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.880
"Kamikaze"?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.850
I've read about that from some document...

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:37.800
No matter! I can easily counter
 such a crude tactic, Sir Daram!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.230
Don't take them so lightly, Gije.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.140
Those who can't keep a cool head
 under pressure are doomed to fail!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:43.680
Yes sir!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.720
Avoid the Heavy Mobile Mechas'
 attacks! Aim only at their ships!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.820
They're getting better at this!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.080
Dodge them, Cosmo!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.040
I'm too busy trying to target the missiles!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.080
Cosmo! There's a Heavy Mobile
Mecha unit to our left! Watch out!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:08.670
Damn it!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.940
Joliver! Set the normal engine to maximum output!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.510
We're all going to hell at this rate!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.800
The engine is burning up! Be quiet!

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:22.180
What's wrong with the cooling device?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.640
The circuits are about to blow!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.520
An explosion! Medics, get to block 26!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.270
I've been hit?!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.820
Gije's Ganga Lubu, and the Gabro Zan?!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.200
How arrogant!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.460
They got a direct hit!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.160
Sir Daram!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:52.230
If something happens to Daram Zuba, the man
 who hired me, my honor will be tarnished!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:12:00.690
Damn that Heavy Mobile Mecha!
I'm going to finish this fight right now!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.570
Fire the missiles!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:24.470
What?!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.560
Why'd it have to explode here?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.310
No!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.350
This is my chance.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.190
Take control of the Ganga Lubu!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.610
I'll plant nuclear bombs on the Giant!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.310
You won't get away!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.760
If I let them go here...

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:46.200
Damn!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.590
The bleeding hasn't stopped...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.220
Moera! Take over the controls for a bit!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.550
Are you injured, Cosmo?!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.220
No!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.520
It's the Buff Clan!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.580
Cosmo? What's wrong?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.240
Cosmo!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.910
What about the Buff Clan?

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:35.580
In front!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.830
Kasha! Take over the controls!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.350
I'm going outside to help Cosmo!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.760
The Ideon has stopped moving!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.590
What happened?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:48.450
I don't know what the situation is!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:52.660
A single Heavy Mobile Mecha has
 strayed from the battle, too!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:53.510
Watch out!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:20.700
Cosmo!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.630
Cosmo!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.730
Never mind me! He planted
 nuclear bombs, find them!

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.670
Nuclear bombs? Where, Cosmo!?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.900
The Ideon's right ear, right
shoulder and abdomen!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.520
Got it!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.770
Kasha! Can you find the bomb on the abdomen?

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:40.940
I found it!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.900
I've failed?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.110
Cosmo!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.170
Your space suit is full of blood!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.150
Cosmo!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.700
Cosmo! Come on!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.120
Cosmo! Cosmo!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.060
Bring me to the cockpit...

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.110
Gije is coming!

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.490
Thanks.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.970
Listen, leave everything to us, okay?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.280
Cosmo! Is he alright?

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:35.950
I don't know.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.830
Kasha! Where's the enemy?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.580
There's a Heavy Mobile Mecha to the lower left!

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.960
I'll stop them even if it costs my life!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.790
Moera! Hurry!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.890
Kasha! Pull back! Fire the missiles!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.810
Don't pull back! If you do, the
 enemy's firepower will destroy us!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.430
The enemy's huge! It's impossible!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.230
If we're going to die, we'll take them down with us!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.840
Kasha! Raise the power to maximum!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:08.660
Roger!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.030
Cursed Logo Dau Giant!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.530
Damn Giant! You'll never escape!

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.340
Dock out!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.340
The Giant machines... Well played!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.400
Cosmo! The Ideo-Buster broke free!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:55.680
Cosmo!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:56.740
Solo Ship!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.180
Solo Ship, do you copy?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.080
The Heavy Mobile Mecha have been destroyed!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.290
We need to dock fast!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.370
Cosmo is injured!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.100
What's wrong, Lin?

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.810
That girl who was with Cosmo...

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.350
Kitty Kitten?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.940
Yeah, I don't see that girl around here...

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:30.110
The Solo Ship and Ideon are coming back,
 so I wonder what she is doing...

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.610
Now that you mention it,
 I haven't seen her in a while.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.150
I'll go look for her!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.070
Deck, wait! Deck!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.220
I'm coming too.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:46.160
Lou, what is it? The Solo Ship
is coming back victorious.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:56.470
Go straight this way! There's a
 place where you can find food!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.720
Just a little longer! You're almost there.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.260
Tom?! Where are you going?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:03.720
Tom!

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.250
You should be guiding the kids to shelter!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.480
Kitten! Isn't that an alien machine?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.570
Tom! Forget about them!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.150
Tom! Come back!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.030
I saw some aliens!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:18.860
I'll shoot them!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:19.530
Tom!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:24.120
Tom!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:28.650
Oh no!!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.840
It was a kid...

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:39.800
Have you fixed it?

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:40.810
We can take off!

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:42.450
All right! Let's get out of here!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:55.850
<i><i>Even after death, we'll meet again in time</i></i>

00:18:56.250 --> 00:19:02.360
<i><i>To keep on living would bring you only sorrow</i></i>

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:08.810
<i><i>We had a sudden brush with love</i></i>

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:15.820
<i><i>Only to remain locked inside my memories</i></i>

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:21.720
<i><i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i></i>

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:28.680
<i><i>I'll send a prayer your way</i></i>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:35.020
<i><i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i></i>

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:42.240
<i><i>I'll send a prayer your way</i></i>

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.850
My blood type hasn't been checked yet...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.520
Cosmo has type O blood, though...

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.910
We should still analyze it.

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.500
Eat all you want!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.510
Don't spill your soup now!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.350
Cheer up, everyone!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.730
You have to cheer up, Kitty Kitten
wouldn't want to see you sad.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:16.890
There might still be Buff Clan soldiers hiding on Caral.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.550
This place is no longer safe.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.840
Are we going on another wandering journey?

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.860
No. We need to convince Karala
 and strike the Buff Clan homeworld!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.080
There's Gloria, too.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.290
I can research the Ide if we make
 arrangements with the military.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.570
And we can think of a method to invade the Buff Clan.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:38.210
Karala!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.180
This is the Planet Solo... Logo Dau, right?

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.100
Using that as the center...

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:56.140
The Buff Clan Earth is 2.5 million light years
 away in the direction the of Y-23 and S-58 axes.

00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.110
Karala...

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:00.940
Karala, is this alright?

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.570
It's only about five million
light years from Earth...

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.660
So that's the Buff Clan's planet?

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:08.070
But why?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:10.410
Why did you suddenly feel like telling us?

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.540
I couldn't stand to see you suffer.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.000
But that's not the only reason.

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:21.210
Your planet will be engulfed
in the flames of war.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.500
Please find a solution that
doesn't result in that happening.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.320
I beg you.

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:30.680
Karala! Please! You're Type O too! 
Come in for the transfusion!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:31.260
Yes!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.450
Karala's blood is Type O?

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.640
Type O is exceedingly rare...

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:38.770
Why?

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.820
Yeah! Why did Karala have
a sudden change of heart?

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:44.120
She's fallen in love with Bes...

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.370
No, it couldn't be that.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.820
What do you think, Bes?

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.570
How should I know?

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.830
Karala is the daughter of a samurai.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:58.240
She's not the kind of woman who would
 sell out her planet simply out of gratitude.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.720
I don't believe she's that kind of woman.

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:04.460
Our Earth is here.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:08.720
Buff Clan, Planet Solo, and
Earth all line up perfectly.

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:12.810
Is this a coincidence?

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:31.480
Cosmo still doesn't know about Kitty Kitten's death.

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:39.370
And not a single person knew that
a new power was about to be born...

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:53.140
<i>The Solo Ship heads towards Earth to research the Ide.</i>

00:22:54.050 --> 00:22:58.180
